        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Korean shamanism</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1100 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Origin</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/korea">Korea</a>; the origins are unclear and the earliest historical references to mudang date to the 12th century, though Musok is often perceived as ancient.</span></div>
